      <abstract>
        <para>
          After installing &productname;, prepare the operating system to ensure system stability
          and compliance before deploying your &sap; landscape. To prepare &productnameshort;
          workloads, install required &sap; software patterns, verify system tuning with &saptune;
          and confirm &selnx; security settings before installing &hana; or &netweaver;
          applications.
